<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>成都旅游攻略</title>
<style>
    :root {
        --bg-color: #3b4668;
        --text-white: #ffffff;
        --text-yellow: #fce255;
        --text-green: #e5f356;
        --text-pink: #ff85a2;
        --text-blue: #6ee5ff;
        --stroke-color: #000000;
    }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px 10px;
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text-white);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 500px;
        background-color: var(--bg-color);
    }

    /* Header Styles */
    header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .title-line-1 {
        font-size: 38px;
        font-weight: 900;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 5px;
        line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .t-white {
        color: var(--text-white);
        text-shadow: 
            -2px -2px 0 var(--stroke-color),  
             2px -2px 0 var(--stroke-color),
            -2px  2px 0 var(--stroke-color),
             2px  2px 0 var(--stroke-color),
             3px  3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .t-pink {
        color: var(--text-pink);
        text-shadow: 
            -2px -2px 0 var(--text-white),  
             2px -2px 0 var(--text-white),
            -2px  2px 0 var(--text-white),
             2px  2px 0 var(--text-white),
             3px  4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .title-line-2 {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 900;
        margin-top: 5px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 15px;
    }

    .t-blue {
        font-size: 58px;
        color: var(--text-blue);
        line-height: 0.8;
        text-shadow: 
            -2px -2px 0 var(--text-white),  
             2px -2px 0 var(--text-white),
            -2px  2px 0 var(--text-white),
             2px  2px 0 var(--text-white),
             4px  5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .divider {
        border-top: 3px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        margin: 15px 10px 25px 10px;
    }

    /* Timeline Layout */
    .timeline-container {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
        gap: 25px 10px;
        position: relative;
    }

    /* Continuous Dashed Line */
    .timeline-container::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 25px;
        bottom: 50px;
        left: 40px; /* Center of the 80px column */
        width: 0;
        border-left: 3px dashed var(--text-white);
        z-index: 1;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    .tl-left {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
    }

    /* Timeline Markers */
    .marker {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        background-color: var(--text-white);
        border: 2px solid var(--stroke-color);
        box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .marker.cloud {
        color: #a32222;
        border-radius: 25px;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .marker.oval {
        color: #000;
        border-radius: 50%;
        width: 65px;
        height: 65px;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 900;
    }

    /* Arrows on the timeline */
    .with-arrow::before {
        content: '↓';
        position: absolute;
        top: -28px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        color: var(--text-white);
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: bold;
        background-color: var(--bg-color); /* Hides the dashed line behind it */
        padding: 4px 0;
        z-index: 3;
    }

    /* Right Column Content */
    .tl-right {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .summary-box {
        font-size: 14.5px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        font-weight: bold;
        padding-top: 5px;
    }

    .summary-box p {
        margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    }

    .cost-text {
        color: var(--text-green);
    }

    /* Card Details */
    .card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .placeholder {
        width: 105px;
        height: 105px;
        background-color: #2a334e;
        border: 2px solid var(--text-white);
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #8fa3cc;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 5px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        object-fit: cover;
    }

    .card-info {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 5px;
    }

    .card-title {
        color: var(--text-yellow);
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        text-shadow: 
            -1px -1px 0 var(--stroke-color),  
             1px -1px 0 var(--stroke-color),
            -1px  1px 0 var(--stroke-color),
             1px  1px 0 var(--stroke-color),
             2px  2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .info-row {
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.4;
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 4px;
    }

    .icon {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <div class="title-line-1">
            <span class="t-white">来成都旅游的</span>
            <span class="t-pink">正确玩法</span>
        </div>
        <div class="title-line-2">
            三天两夜人均 <span class="t-blue">900</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="timeline-container">

        <!-- Summary Section -->
        <div class="tl-left">
            <div class="marker cloud">第二天</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-right summary-box">
            <p>行程: 大熊猫基地→文殊院→望平街→东郊记忆</p>
            <p class="cost-text">人均消费: 门票55/27元+吃饭150元+交通25元+住宿100元=300左右</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stop 1: Pandas -->
        <div class="tl-left">
            <div class="marker oval with-arrow">上午</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-right card">
            <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Pandas in trees]</div>
            <div class="card-info">
                <div class="card-title">大熊猫基地</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💰</span>门票: 全票55, 半票27</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">🚗</span>交通: 地铁3号线, 熊猫大道站</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💬</span>简介: 成都旅游必打卡国宝熊猫, 里面有许多可爱的熊猫可以近距离观察</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stop 2: Temple -->
        <div class="tl-left">
            <!-- Empty left column, timeline dashed line passes through -->
        </div>
        <div class="tl-right card">
            <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Yellow temple wall]</div>
            <div class="card-info">
                <div class="card-title">文殊院</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💰</span>门票: 免费开放</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">🚗</span>交通: 地铁1号线直达文殊院站</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💬</span>简介: 位于成都市中区, 既有香火气又有烟火气, 可以烧香拜佛</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stop 3: Street -->
        <div class="tl-left">
            <div class="marker oval with-arrow">下午</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-right card">
            <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Neon street sign]</div>
            <div class="card-info">
                <div class="card-title">望平街</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💰</span>门票: 免费开放</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">🚗</span>交通: 地铁2号线</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💬</span>简介: 街上有咖啡馆、小酒吧、面包店等, 是一条文艺浪漫的街区</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stop 4: Park -->
        <div class="tl-left">
            <div class="marker oval with-arrow">晚上</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-right card">
            <div class="placeholder">[Photo: Train in park]</div>
            <div class="card-info">
                <div class="card-title">东郊记忆</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💰</span>门票: 免费开放</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">🚗</span>交通: 地铁8号线东郊记忆站</div>
                <div class="info-row"><span class="icon">💬</span>简介: 集合音乐、美术、戏剧、摄影等文化形态的多元文化园区</div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
